# sriq: a FUNCTIONAL role (≤1 r.⊤, DL4). A has an r-successor in B and one in C,
# B and C are disjoint, and r allows one successor: A is unsatisfiable.
# Expect: A unsatisfiable.

@prefix :     <http://example.org/t#> .
@prefix owl:  <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .

<http://example.org/t> a owl:Ontology .
:A a owl:Class . :B a owl:Class . :C a owl:Class .
:r a owl:ObjectProperty , owl:FunctionalProperty .
:B owl:disjointWith :C .
:A rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty :r ; owl:someValuesFrom :B ] ,
                   [ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty :r ; owl:someValuesFrom :C ] .
